{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_title", "source_sha256": "bee0909e949148aa643a049c5079ab83ebf2592a1b5812abf1582f441fef4336", "ja": "亜美とおでかけ1", "zh": "和亚美外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edf36fa178e78623b3748ed6ca1ea0a519a1b858dfb9306514bd80e626ac1e3c", "ja": "亜美とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和亚美外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e0eed80ff742852fb6a51ffbc8c045febe1a64dc4ed7c8fdc8409e101dc0ab1a", "ja": "（今日の亜美の仕事は、面白い事をしつつ、大阪の\n粉ものをアピールする難易度の高い物。果たして……）", "zh": "（今天亚美的工作，是一边做有趣的事，一边宣传大阪的面食，难度相当高。究竟会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "6cf7a3f32a61b75e22132192266e71589a66e073623d9aa122b7091d632e1321", "ja": "兄やん、こない茶しばいとる場合やないっちゅーねん！\nなんやおもろいアイディア出しぃや！", "zh": "大哥，现在可不是喝茶的时候啊！赶紧想个有意思的点子出来呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a911c4d020deeae41d775fedb6c7d1934aed638be4f3a354355c2d180f1ff186", "ja": "お、おう……。そうだな……というか、\n今の時点でかなり面白い気はするけど……。", "zh": "哦、哦……是啊……话说回来，我觉得现在这样已经相当有意思了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "cd035b26d9fb5baba8d39cc984d7e14bbd395e07fdb15e2f231772965dfc06cb", "ja": "ちゃうやん！　大阪の人はみんな大阪弁つことる\nさかい、亜美のこのべしゃりは普通やってんばってん！", "zh": "不是嘛！大阪人不都是说大阪话的吗，所以亚美这样说很正常啦，不过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b9413736cba67ac99b7ff1a0d3377427375bfe50987570f1d33b73e1a17fe752", "ja": "やってんばってん？\nなんだか、大阪弁として合ってない気が……。", "zh": "讲得来搞得来？\n总觉得这好像不太对劲，不太像大阪话啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "bb5eaff424311ea7ccc85853ea8f0ceae5411142ce825e7fa9cf179ca1d276d0", "ja": "知らんがな……あ。それで行けばいいんじゃない！？\n弱点を活かすんや！", "zh": "我咋知道……啊。就这么用不就行了！？\n把弱点变成优势嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "0d2fedfe8dd033ebb603c7d3fd1728cf8d72fcb2c252a9817d4747e486cc6c5d", "ja": "偽大阪弁でドッカンドッカンやいね～！", "zh": "用假大阪腔让大家笑翻天吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2759ae5bca98037278177db2d14c36af03cb038a98958d770d02a329d8684df7", "ja": "な、なるほど……そう言われると、\n説得力がある気がしてきた。", "zh": "这、这样一说……好像确实很有说服力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "1184e564dacc9a8489dc9b78fe2bae06cd660af40e399739510553fa4abf6fdc", "ja": "なっはっは！　亜美はやっぱ天才やっちゅーねんな！\nこれでウチの事務所もチャリンチャリンぜよ！", "zh": "哈哈哈哈！所以说，亚美果然是天才嘛！这样一来，咱们事务所就能财源滚滚啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "22e94b678530ddeb97942565c99a16113f22dd1f42e48fa05c8498bdd9a1baf7", "ja": "アイドルがそういう生々しい事を言わない！\nと、とにかく粉もののアピール、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "偶像不该说这种太露骨的话！\n总、总之，粉食的宣传就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "45db2ae7e2f982f778e0811ea038594ee789216c4343bcd8d44a11fd254fc72f", "ja": "（本番、亜美は観客からツッコミを入れられながら、\nそこそこウケていた……やったな、亜美！）", "zh": "（正式演出时，亚美一边被观众吐槽，一边还挺受欢迎的……干得好，亚美！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
